To ensure the accuracy of this causal diagram, we used the reliable DAG with NO TEARS algorithm ([Zheng et al. 2018](https://arxiv.org/html/2405.10746v2#bib.bib36)). By comparing the diagrams generated by both methods, we found them nearly identical, further validating the correctness of our causal graph from the I​C∗IC^{\ast} algorithm.

